    "name": "Meta Soulmate",
    "steam_appid": 2656330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta Soulmate is a virtual mate creation tool that allows you to craft your own virtual companion through a game-style character customization tool. With it, you can debut as a VTuber or create your own secret friend.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/17c7d809091230f4b81e6be835c81e42.poster.avif?t=1747300968\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/17c7d809091230f4b81e6be835c81e42.webm?t=1747300968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/17c7d809091230f4b81e6be835c81e42.mp4?t=1747300968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Implement the excitement of beginning in our own way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project aims to convey the excitement felt when creating oneself or another character while enjoying various games or services. Materialize the emotions of that experience and feel the thrill of completing the project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/42807b3bdd9010f424f9540404ed26a6.avif?t=1747300968\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your own character with infinite possibilities.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The possibilities of your own character are endless. Especially for VTubers, we plan to provide an all-in-one tool, allowing you to debut as a VTuber in the easiest way possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/d2097867bd68b41db498448f9899c081.poster.avif?t=1747300968\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/d2097867bd68b41db498448f9899c081.webm?t=1747300968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/d2097867bd68b41db498448f9899c081.mp4?t=1747300968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Costume parts that maximize a multitude of possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Efforts were made to divide all costumes into individual parts, maximizing a myriad of possibilities, allowing you to express each soulmate\u2019s individuality beyond simply predefined costume templates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/c54f725ba93ff4c5d647bba139b54af1.poster.avif?t=1747300968\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/c54f725ba93ff4c5d647bba139b54af1.webm?t=1747300968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Texture editing feature designed to create Soulmates with true uniqueness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely edit not only the costumes but also the textures of face and body, allowing for a truly unique Soulmate. Showcase your skills to create a one-of-a-kind Soulmate that is exclusively yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/2f45bcef1dce37839853da6fc8521c66.poster.avif?t=1747300968\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/2f45bcef1dce37839853da6fc8521c66.webm?t=1747300968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/2f45bcef1dce37839853da6fc8521c66.mp4?t=1747300968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meta Soulmate's unique and easy makeup method</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta Soulmate introduces a new approach to makeup editing, allowing for both freedom and simplicity. Save your character's portrait as a standard 2D image file. Edit the image in any way you like, and those changes will seamlessly reflect on the 3D character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/1c6adc29d0263b70249ad39d5792e632.poster.avif?t=1747300968\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/1c6adc29d0263b70249ad39d5792e632.webm?t=1747300968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/1c6adc29d0263b70249ad39d5792e632.mp4?t=1747300968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future of Meta Soulmate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the initial excitement, we are preparing various contents for you to freely enjoy with the Meta Soulmates you create. They will be gradually released through Steam. Look forward to the unique experience laid before you and your Meta Soulmate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/81b283775ccc5b3383caf5aa324810ac.avif?t=1747300968\" data-has-big width=800 height=582 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta Soulmate is a virtual mate creation tool that allows you to craft your own virtual companion through a game-style character customization tool. With it, you can debut as a VTuber or create your own secret friend.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/17c7d809091230f4b81e6be835c81e42.poster.avif?t=1747300968\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/17c7d809091230f4b81e6be835c81e42.webm?t=1747300968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/17c7d809091230f4b81e6be835c81e42.mp4?t=1747300968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Implement the excitement of beginning in our own way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project aims to convey the excitement felt when creating oneself or another character while enjoying various games or services. Materialize the emotions of that experience and feel the thrill of completing the project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/42807b3bdd9010f424f9540404ed26a6.avif?t=1747300968\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your own character with infinite possibilities.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The possibilities of your own character are endless. Especially for VTubers, we plan to provide an all-in-one tool, allowing you to debut as a VTuber in the easiest way possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/d2097867bd68b41db498448f9899c081.poster.avif?t=1747300968\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/d2097867bd68b41db498448f9899c081.webm?t=1747300968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/d2097867bd68b41db498448f9899c081.mp4?t=1747300968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Costume parts that maximize a multitude of possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Efforts were made to divide all costumes into individual parts, maximizing a myriad of possibilities, allowing you to express each soulmate\u2019s individuality beyond simply predefined costume templates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/c54f725ba93ff4c5d647bba139b54af1.poster.avif?t=1747300968\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/c54f725ba93ff4c5d647bba139b54af1.webm?t=1747300968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Texture editing feature designed to create Soulmates with true uniqueness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely edit not only the costumes but also the textures of face and body, allowing for a truly unique Soulmate. Showcase your skills to create a one-of-a-kind Soulmate that is exclusively yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/2f45bcef1dce37839853da6fc8521c66.poster.avif?t=1747300968\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/2f45bcef1dce37839853da6fc8521c66.webm?t=1747300968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/2f45bcef1dce37839853da6fc8521c66.mp4?t=1747300968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meta Soulmate's unique and easy makeup method</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta Soulmate introduces a new approach to makeup editing, allowing for both freedom and simplicity. Save your character's portrait as a standard 2D image file. Edit the image in any way you like, and those changes will seamlessly reflect on the 3D character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/1c6adc29d0263b70249ad39d5792e632.poster.avif?t=1747300968\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/1c6adc29d0263b70249ad39d5792e632.webm?t=1747300968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/1c6adc29d0263b70249ad39d5792e632.mp4?t=1747300968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future of Meta Soulmate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the initial excitement, we are preparing various contents for you to freely enjoy with the Meta Soulmates you create. They will be gradually released through Steam. Look forward to the unique experience laid before you and your Meta Soulmate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656330/extras/81b283775ccc5b3383caf5aa324810ac.avif?t=1747300968\" data-has-big width=800 height=582 /></span></p>",
